</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 648)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>End a review you left running.</b> Every live row in Past Reviews has an End Review button, and End All Live Reviews sits above the list. Ending a review stops its link showing media, tells pages that cached it, and releases the studio watcher&#8217;s seat in that room.</li>
<li><b>One watcher email a day.</b> The studio watcher now sends the owners a single daily record covering every review where something was said, instead of one email per room, and rooms where people only came and went are recorded without a mail.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
